    <briefdescription>
<para>Holds the RX tuning related information. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The RX tuning algorithm compares the data read at every RX tap against a reference pattern which is expected to be pre-programmed in the flash. The application owns the pattern and fills this structure in the driver instance before switching to a PHY mode using <ref refid="group__ospipsv_1ga74efb98d92b16935c3ea41e4f77cecea" kindref="member">XOspiPsv_SetSdrDdrMode()</ref>. It supplies the reference data, the location of the pattern in flash, the read instruction used to fetch it and the buffer it is read into. </para>    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="/proj/xhdsswstaff1/bhawanas/patch_integration/auto_jobs/esw_github_doxy/git/2026.2/embeddedsw/XilinxProcessorIPLib/drivers/ospipsv/src/xospipsv.h" line="139" column="1" bodyfile="/proj/xhdsswstaff1/bhawanas/patch_integration/auto_jobs/esw_github_doxy/git/2026.2/embeddedsw/XilinxProcessorIPLib/drivers/ospipsv/src/xospipsv.h" bodystart="139" bodyend="151"/>
